  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "2.0.0: CancellationToken support on every API; obsolete overloads without a token. Modern Chat DTOs (tools, structured output, multimodal content, max_completion_tokens, typed logprobs/annotations/audio, refusal). Configurable Timeout (honoured end-to-end via an infinite-timeout named HttpClient) and named HttpClient. Dedicated OpenAiResponseFormatException and OpenAiTimeoutException (RequestUri, Timeout). Input validation with clear exceptions. Robust HTTP handling: streamed JSON, empty/204 bodies, 64 KB error-body cap, URL escaping, ConfigureAwait(false). Richer DTOs (file status details, image usage, token details, model/image metadata). Image model/quality/output format/background for generation and editing; mask filename defaults to mask.png. Breaking: CreateImageEditAsync gained quality/outputFormat/background, EmbeddingsRequest.Input and ApiCompletionRequest.Stop accept objects, ChatCompletionChoice.Logprobs and chat annotation/audio payloads are typed, FileDetails.StatusDetails and CreateImageResponse.Usage retyped, deserialization failures throw OpenAiResponseFormatException, timeouts throw OpenAiTimeoutException.",
